   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "HER MOTION BOARD\n1. Write what she does in the prompt (\"A woman ...\" works best), pick seconds and a seed, and the poses she starts and ends in (standing, sitting, lying...). Same as start = it loops back.\n2. Queue (Ctrl+Enter). The first take of a session waits a few minutes while Kimodo's text encoder loads; after that a take is about 20 s.\n3. The skeleton preview plays on the right; the checker's verdict shows under it.\n4. Like it? Turn on \"Preview: On Her Body\" (Ctrl+M) to see it on her in her room (about a minute).\n5. Keep it: turn on \"Add To Her Clips\", name it with a role prefix (idle_happy_, solo_, play_...), queue again. It repacks her clips; restart her body to use it.\nChange the seed for another take of the same prompt."
   ]
  }
